OL,3,AFaisal Islam: The 10-year plan will
OL,4,Ahave to fill the gaps from this 'micro
OL,5,ABudget'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was not a mini Budget, but it was
OL,8,Frather small. It might be called the
OL,9,F"micro Budget".
OL,11,FSmall does not necessarily mean bad,
OL,12,Fbut it clearly falls short of radical
OL,13,Faction to create a promised new
OL,14,Feconomic model.
OL,16,FA new "theory of growth" was not
OL,17,Funveiled as promised by the prime
OL,18,Fminister Andy Burnham.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
