OL,3,AFaisal Islam: The 10-year plan will
OL,4,Ahave to fill the gaps from this 'micro
OL,5,ABudget'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was preamble, roadmap, consultation,
OL,8,Fperhaps the starter to the main course,
OL,9,Fwhich appears to be the PM's 10-year
OL,10,Fplan next month.
